              "value": "Blinding Bile"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(acid, evocation)\n\nThe excorion paragon projects a mist of burning blood in a 10-foot cone.\n\nCreatures in the area take 10d8 acid damage and 5d8 bludgeoning damage (basic 37 Reflex save). On a failed save, an affected creature is also blinded for 1 round (or 2 rounds on a critical failure). The excorion can't using Blinding Bile again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
